  id: ma_exeminer_exam_details
  text: "First, Control. Approach the focus orb and channel your symbol into it.
    Let\u2019s see if you can keep your mana steady.\n\nSecond, Pressure. When you\u2019re
    ready, step onto the marked seal. You\u2019ll face a test of reflex and focus,
    destroy the targets before they vanish.\n\nAnd finally, Combat. Move to the central
    arena and declare your readiness. The constructs of the Academy will test your
    skill in real confrontation.\n\nEach test will push you further. Few make it
    through all three, fewer still with their confidence intact."
  options:
  - text: I'm ready.
    nextNodeId: 
